Momento uses the Linear and Bold styles. The plain ×, +, − and ✓ symbols are taken from
the Solar "Close Circle", "Add Circle", "Minus Circle" and "Check Circle" icons with the
outer circle removed and the symbol scaled up; no other icons were modified.
